{"id": "sfo-tutor-saliba-settlement", "title": "After SFO closed out its terminal contract, builders agreed to pay SF $19 million", "seconds": 51.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "eba3a497ff6fd7d9", "words": 153, "beats": [{"scene": "airport", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "When an airport construction contract closed, the commission minutes recorded subcontractor participation.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.29, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closeout", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "Closeout of contract 5500E", "mark": "Closeout of contract 5500E"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.28, 0.67, 1.16, 1.56, 2.3, 2.43, 2.86, 3.25, 3.66, 4.35]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The minutes reported 23.4 percent minority and women’s business participation against a 15 percent goal.", "t0": 5.41, "t1": 11.11, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "23.4%", "label": "Participation reported at closeout"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.86, 1.4, 1.67, 1.87, 2.2, 2.69, 2.81, 3.15, 3.49, 4.25, 4.59, 4.67, 5.07, 5.37]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The commission approved a 4,538,678 dollar modification that adjusted Honeywell’s subcontract.", "t0": 11.23, "t1": 16.78, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closeout", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "June 2001 final modification", "mark": "June 2001 final modification"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.47, 0.86, 0.95, 1.24, 1.51, 1.78, 2.08, 2.39, 2.63, 3.67, 3.88, 4.32, 4.76]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Honeywell objected that its own scope had been settled without its participation.", "t0": 16.9, "t1": 20.25, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One subcontractor objected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.81, 0.94, 1.08, 1.25, 1.6, 1.72, 1.88, 2.21, 2.5, 2.61]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "San Francisco later alleged subcontractor fronts and inflated change orders across airport projects.", "t0": 20.37, "t1": 25.45, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "appeal", "kicker": "California Court of Appeal, First Appellate District", "text": "City allegations", "mark": "City allegations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.79, 1.04, 1.42, 2.22, 2.55, 2.7, 3.13, 3.43, 3.7, 4.02, 4.4]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The appellate ruling dealt with statements the City Attorney made in his official role.", "t0": 25.57, "t1": 29.38, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Scope of the appeal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.46, 0.94, 1.17, 1.3, 1.83, 1.96, 2.2, 2.56, 2.78, 2.89, 3.03, 3.44]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2006, San Francisco authorized a civil settlement with Tutor-Saliba and the joint venture.", "t0": 29.6, "t1": 34.99, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ordinance", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Ordinance 60-06", "mark": "Ordinance 60-06"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.26, 0.57, 1.06, 1.28, 1.86, 2.35, 2.43, 2.71, 3.15, 3.34, 4.37, 4.61, 4.71, 4.95]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The settlement called for 19 million dollars to go to San Francisco.", "t0": 35.11, "t1": 38.0, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$19 million", "label": "Amount due to San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.52, 0.77, 0.92, 1.25, 1.53, 1.88, 1.97, 2.08, 2.16, 2.31]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Four installments were due. The first was eight million dollars and the last was five million.", "t0": 38.12, "t1": 42.56, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Amount due under the ordinance", "heading": "The four installments", "source": "ordinance", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "First installment", "value": "$8 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Next two installments", "value": "$3 million each"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Final installment", "value": "$5 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.77, 0.92, 1.73, 1.89, 2.16, 2.32, 2.52, 2.81, 3.18, 3.29, 3.4, 3.68, 3.82, 4.09]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The ordinance shows the payment terms. We would need receipts to establish which installments the City collected.", "t0": 42.68, "t1": 48.16, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Installment collection", "Individual changes"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.6, 0.9, 0.99, 1.35, 2.13, 2.3, 2.49, 2.71, 3.16, 3.31, 3.81, 4.01, 4.58, 4.69, 4.93]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.28, "t1": 50.42, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"airport": "Closing the airport work", "terms": "Following the settlement terms"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "document"}